src/lib/orchestrator/synthesis.ts — 5 previously-stubbed functions
now implemented per spec:

- computeBaseComposite: 9-slot weighted sum per spec section 1.2
  - 02 cloud_compression 0.25 + 02 ema_accel share 0.20*0.70
  - 08 ema_accel share 0.20*0.30
  - 20 setup_freshness 0.15
  - 09 trigger_body share 0.15*0.65 + 13 trigger_body share 0.15*0.35
  - 04 wick_pen share 0.10*0.60 + 10 wick_pen share 0.10*0.40
  - 19 prior_trigger_outcome 0.15
  Abstention handling per spec section 1.3: pro-rata redistribution,
  +5/+10/+50 abstain_penalty. Distinct-agent abstain count (Agent 02
  filling 2 slots only counts once).

- mapToVerdict: spec section 6 mapping table.
  - non-Variant-A → SKIP_OUT_OF_SCOPE
  - score >= 80 + actionable state → TAKE_NOW
  - 60-79 → WAIT_FOR_LEVEL
  - 40-59 → SETUP_FORMING (TREND_FORMING) or WAIT_FOR_LEVEL
  - <40 → SKIP
  - RANGE_BOUND/INSUFFICIENT_HISTORY → SKIP regardless
  - TREND_ESTABLISHED_RUNNING → WAIT or SKIP regardless of score

- runVetoCascade: priority order 38 → 22 → 23 → 07 → 14 → 25 → 16
  per spec section 7. First veto wins; subsequent vetoes logged.
  Agent 07 chop threshold escalates to 85 on 20s timeframe; Agent 16
  forces soft downgrade not hard SKIP.

- classifyDevilsAdvocate: spec section 8 thresholds (40/65/85)
  → none / add_concern / downgrade_one_tier / force_skip.

- applyDevilsAdvocate: pure verdict transformation per the mode
  adjustment. SKIP_OUT_OF_SCOPE preserved through downgrades.

